he 4070 tie will be  available on January 5th and will retail  at 790 nine dollars according to Nvidia  the RTX 4070 tie is up to three times  faster than the RTX 3090 tie while using  less power like its more expensive  relatives the RTX 4070 tie is capable of  running at over 120 frames per second at  1440p its memory size is smaller with 12  gigs compared to the 4090s 24 gigs and  the 4080s 16. Nvidia also promises that  the gpu's Dual AV encoders will help cut  rendering time for video editors with up  to two times video export speed this is  perfect timing because one thing that I  want to do this year is to kind of  revamp my PC setup maybe build something  from scratch and maybe this 4070 is  exactly what I need let me know in the  comments What GPU you're using right now  I'm still on a 2060 and I'll see you  tomorrow  thank you
 

